OL,3,GNEWSAAndrew Boff leaves London Tories
OL,4,Aafter 53 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of London's longest-serving
OL,7,FConservative politicians has resigned
OL,8,Ffrom the party after 53 years.
OL,10,FAssembly member Andrew Boff said he had
OL,11,Fbeen blocked from entering the race to
OL,12,Fbe the Conservative candidate for
OL,13,FLondon mayor because he supports the
OL,14,FEuropean Convention on Human Rights
OL,15,F(ECHR).
OL,17,FHe called the decision "extraordinary
OL,18,Fand profoundly disappointing".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
