OL,3,GNEWSAAndrew Boff leaves London Tories
OL,4,Aafter 53 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FSusan Hall of the City Hall
OL,7,FConservatives said she "deeply regrets"
OL,8,Fhis resignation but stands resolutely
OL,9,Fby the party's commitment to leaving
OL,10,Fthe ECHR.
